OL,3,AZimbabwean convicted in South Africa of
OL,4,Atrying to fight in Ukraine
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Zimbabwean national has been
OL,7,Fconvicted by a court in South Africa of
OL,8,Fplanning to go to fight in Ukraine.
OL,10,FThe country has strict laws which
OL,11,Frestrict unauthorised involvement in
OL,12,Foverseas wars.
OL,14,FTwenty-four-year-old Wesley Sothole,
OL,15,Fwho pleaded guilty, was handed a
OL,16,Ffive-year suspended prison sentence and
OL,17,Fwas ordered to be deported from South
OL,18,FAfrica.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
