OL,3,AZimbabwean convicted in South Africa of
OL,4,Atrying to fight in Ukraine
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe is one of five Zimbabweans who were
OL,7,Farrested at OR Tambo Airport in
OL,8,FJohannesburg on 8 November. South
OL,9,FAfrican prosecutors have not confirmed
OL,10,Fwhich side the Zimbabweans allegedly
OL,11,Fintended to fight for.
